bol-reuse notes ($T$, $\mathcal{K}$ vs.\ $K$, $\alpha$) were added; Figure~13 was regenerated with a neutral title and the surrounding text now describes measured points rather than an operational frontier; and the single-node scope statements of Sections~5 and~6 state the reference-GPU execution explicitly. The corrected Table~13 is reproduced below.
